I go inside the clinic.
This clinic is very small and it is very crowded here.
I sit on an empty chair in the waiting area.
My health is not fine at all today.
The wait feels long.
I sit with my eyes closed.
I look around the room.
An elderly man is sitting near me.
He is coughing a lot and looking sick.
On the other side, a young mother is sitting.
Her small child is very restless.
He is crying again and again.
The mother is comforting him lovingly.
She says to the child, "Son, you should rest now."
I am also feeling very tired.
I think that I should also go home early and rest.
The receptionist calls people's names one by one.
I wait for my turn patiently.
After fifteen minutes, she takes my name.
I get up slowly and go towards the doctor's room.
